<title>HONG KONG: Baltrans Holdings year net up 4.44 pct.</title>
<headline>Baltrans Holdings year net up 4.44 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended July 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   16.5   vs 18.2</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    6.0    vs 6.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs 3.47 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    39.19  vs 37.53</p>
<p>    Turnover		     913.24 vs 809.13</p>
<p>    Company name		 Baltrans Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  December 16-23</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   December 30</p>
<p>NOTE - Baltrans Holdings is a freight forwarding firm.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is eight H.K. cents (including interim dividend of two cents) vs nine cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
